Read columns in key order: 1, 2, 3, 4.

Ciphertext: TKAATNACDTAW

C. Double Columnar Transposition
Definition: A transposition technique in which columnar transposition is applied twice to increase the difficulty of recovering the original message.

Purpose: Makes the original character order harder to identify.

Important: Letter frequencies remain unchanged because the same letters are only rearranged.

